usage: author_lift_pipeline.py [-h] {prepare,execute} ...

Opt-in source collection -> bounded HOME -> any-original-body lift. No
preparation starts Kit, inference, collection execution or training. Execution
requires a separate explicit command and consumes its single attempt on start.
Historical transport protocols and their bin task remain separate.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,execute}

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
